    - title: Wild at Heart
      description: The golden wild card matches any keepsake - and finds its twin for you!
      tip: Flip the wild card together with any keepsake to match all of its kind.
    - title: Sleight of Hand
      description: Nimble fingers! After every third mistake the hidden cards swap places.
      tip: Three mistakes and the dealer shuffles the hidden cards!
    - title: Silk and Danger
      description: Two bombs hide behind the silk. Each one costs a heart - remember where they are!
      tip: 
    - title: Running Order
      description: Tonight's parade has a running order! Match the keepsakes in the order shown at the top.
      tip: Only the keepsake the parade asks for counts. Remember the others for later!
